{title: Praise God from Whom All Blessings Flow}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C]Praise [**]God from [Am]whom all [F]bles[G]sings [C]flow;
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
